        contoh_kalimat:'My favorite season is summer. — Musim favoritku adalah panas.\nIt is hot in summer. — Panas di musim panas.\nLeaves fall in autumn. — Daun berjatuhan di musim gugur.\nIt snows in winter. — Turun salju di musim dingin.',
